==== Installation using the TFTP method ====
[[#serial|Serial TTL cable]] adapter required.
| {{:meta:icons:tango:software-update-urgent.png|}} | **WARNING:** Do **NOT** use //openwrt-96368MVWG-generic-squashfs-cfe.bin// for flashing this router. This image is for another different router and not compatible. Use //openwrt-DGND3700v1_3800B-squashfs-cfe.bin// instead. |

=== Method 1 (.bin firmwares) ===
  - Set the IP at your pc to 192.168.1.35 (or any compatible), and connect the ethernet cable to the router.
  - Connect the [[#serial|serial]] TTL cable, turn on the router and break into CFE pressing any key.
  - Start a TFTP server in your PC. Copy //openwrt-DGND3700v1_3800B-squashfs-cfe.bin// firmware to the server.
  - Execute the comand **//f 192.168.1.35:openwrt-DGND3700v1_3800B-squashfs-cfe.bin//** in the CFE console.


