==== SPI ====
**[[wp>Serial_Peripheral_Interface_Bus|Serial Peripheral Interface]]** 

The BCM6368 SoC has a [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.broadcom.bcm63xx#spi|SPI]] controller. On this board the pins are exposed, at the place for probably a VoIP Legerity chip which isn't soldered. We can use this SPI interface for connecting our own SPI stuff, but we need to build the kernel with the drivers and proper platform data code for registering the SPI device. This is the pinout:

{{media:netgear:dgnd3700:dgnd3700v1_spi-leg.jpg?direct&400x300|}}

Kernel code example for **spidev** kernel module (board_bcm963xx.c), the added code is diff highlighted:

<code diff>
